| `v8_cn_fetch_cloud_selfhosted.yml` 4 前缀 | 177 | 177 | ✅ |
| `v8_algo_run.yml` algorithms+单文件+根py | 126 | 126 | ✅ |
| `v8_stock_quote_refresh*.yml` algorithms+根py | 125 | 125 | ✅ |

